# Stat infographic fonts: ship only the static instances actually loaded by the
# renderer; the source variable font is kept in-repo for provenance but is dead
# weight (~9.5 MB) in the image and is never loaded (satori cannot parse its fvar).
assets/fonts/*-VF.ttf

